<title>JAPAN: Japan Sept silver imports rise 59.6 pct year/year.</title>
<headline>Japan Sept silver imports rise 59.6 pct year/year.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's silver imports in September rose 59.6 percent from the same month a year earlier, according to Finance Ministry data released on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The figures were as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		     Sept 96	Aug 96	  Sept 95</p>
<p> Total	     159.46	  88.57	   99.91</p>
<p> Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Mexico	     54.63	  55.36	   36.00</p>
<p> U.S.		 95.60	   0.00	   16.18</p>
<p>Cumulative imports in the first nine months of 1996 were 905.01 tonnes against 1,025.91 in the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-7431</p>
</text>
